# Steddy Graph Interaction — a Light/Standard/Pro segmented control; switching springs
# the selection pill and morphs a 27-point Skia score graph (withSpring on an array).
# What this test covers: every segment in both directions, first<->last jumps,
# re-tapping the selected segment, and very fast switching so the array spring
# and the pill spring are retargeted mid-flight several times.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/steddy-graph-interaction"
wait "text" "Standard" 10000
press "text=\"Light\""
wait 900
press "text=\"Pro\""
wait 900
press "text=\"Standard\""
wait 900
press "text=\"Pro\""
wait 900
press "text=\"Light\""
wait 900
# Re-tap the selected segment.
press "text=\"Light\""
wait 500
# Fast switching mid-spring.
press "text=\"Pro\""
wait 80
press "text=\"Light\""
wait 80
press "text=\"Standard\""
wait 80
press "text=\"Pro\""
wait 80
press "text=\"Light\""
wait 80
press "text=\"Pro\""
wait 1500
press "text=\"Standard\""
wait 1200
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
